WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.128 --> 01:44.104
=Episode 8=

01:46.150 --> 01:46.710
Mr. Gao.

01:47.430 --> 01:48.950
Dr. Liu Yan has rejected our contract.

01:48.950 --> 01:50.150
Should we negotiate further?

01:53.870 --> 01:54.430
Stop it.

01:55.109 --> 01:56.630
But all our previous efforts...

01:57.150 --> 01:57.909
It's unnecessary.

01:58.870 --> 02:00.269
Fuchuang won't give us a chance.

02:05.109 --> 02:05.710
Alright.

02:06.389 --> 02:07.109
Understood.

02:17.576 --> 02:18.792
(Text, Lin Huan'er)

02:18.792 --> 02:19.589
(New Message)

02:19.589 --> 02:20.549
(Today's Tip.)

02:20.910 --> 02:23.190
(Take a break downstairs between work.)

02:37.310 --> 02:38.269
Never seen this before?

02:39.510 --> 02:40.630
This is nothing.

02:41.230 --> 02:42.709
There's also fish mint Americano,

02:42.910 --> 02:43.989
Chinese wine Latte,

02:44.269 --> 02:45.589
Cilantro Latte,

02:45.869 --> 02:47.269
and Chili oil Americano.

02:47.549 --> 02:48.790
I'll let you try it next time.

02:54.869 --> 02:55.510
Go ahead.

03:04.070 --> 03:04.750
Isn't this...

03:04.750 --> 03:05.669
Exactly.

03:06.030 --> 03:08.389
This is the Coffee
on the Left Bank by the Seine.

03:10.310 --> 03:11.709
Its secret recipe is right here.

03:17.070 --> 03:17.709
Do you like it?

03:20.910 --> 03:21.829
Lately,

03:21.829 --> 03:23.109
you always seem troubled.

03:23.669 --> 03:25.790
Is there a problem at the company?

03:26.389 --> 03:27.350
You can tell me.

03:27.350 --> 03:28.470
Maybe I'll have an idea

03:28.470 --> 03:29.510
and help you solve it.

03:30.230 --> 03:30.910
It's nothing.

03:31.230 --> 03:32.669
There's a problem with the R&D team.

03:36.669 --> 03:37.750
Normally, you would

03:37.750 --> 03:39.510
have a backup plan ready.

03:39.989 --> 03:41.630
Seems like someone's behind this.

03:48.829 --> 03:51.230
(If I can help him
solve the expert issue)

03:52.030 --> 03:54.149
(would that make
his fondness for me increase,)

03:54.310 --> 03:55.589
(or even make him like me?)

03:57.549 --> 03:59.030
Don't be so stressed.

04:01.869 --> 04:02.549
This is for you.

04:03.630 --> 04:04.310
Sorry, wrong one.

04:06.070 --> 04:06.829
This one's for you.

04:07.470 --> 04:09.070
Squeeze it when you're stressed.

04:09.470 --> 04:11.549
And when your shoulders or neck ache,
give it a tap.

04:11.549 --> 04:12.350
It works magic.

04:17.510 --> 04:18.149
Thanks.

04:22.216 --> 04:25.320
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

04:25.320 --> 04:25.992
(Sanitary Pad Material Research
and Improvement Practice)

04:25.992 --> 04:30.120
♪Timelines, tangled♪

04:30.952 --> 04:34.568
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

04:34.568 --> 04:37.800
♪Heart pounding, won't stop♪

04:37.864 --> 04:41.672
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

04:41.672 --> 04:45.960
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

04:46.696 --> 04:50.312
♪Your smile is like stars that shimmer♪

04:50.632 --> 04:55.944
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

04:57.224 --> 05:04.744
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

05:04.744 --> 05:12.520
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

05:13.000 --> 05:20.520
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

05:20.872 --> 05:25.576
♪Streaking across the sky♪

05:26.152 --> 05:33.864
♪Just to hold you♪

05:44.776 --> 05:48.648
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

05:48.872 --> 05:52.808
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

05:53.512 --> 05:57.160
♪Your smile is like stars that shimmer♪

05:57.480 --> 06:02.664
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

06:04.968 --> 06:05.990
Luo,

06:06.709 --> 06:08.520
this list is well-organized.

06:10.950 --> 06:11.750
Make arrangements

06:12.190 --> 06:13.630
to visit these companies tomorrow.

06:13.630 --> 06:14.149
Okay.

06:16.029 --> 06:17.709
Where did this list come from?

06:18.110 --> 06:19.110
I didn't make it.

06:21.789 --> 06:22.389
I'm on it.

06:27.688 --> 06:32.424
♪Streaking across the sky♪

06:37.389 --> 06:38.389
Dr. Li, hi.

06:38.789 --> 06:39.909
Mr. Gao.

06:39.990 --> 06:41.029
You came in person.

06:41.310 --> 06:43.630
Do you have other questions?

06:45.310 --> 06:46.229
What do you mean?

06:46.789 --> 06:47.670
Someone named Lin

06:47.670 --> 06:49.750
from Letao's R&D department

06:49.750 --> 06:51.589
has discussed
the material issues with us.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.430
So, to what do we owe the honor?

06:53.430 --> 06:54.829
In our R&D depart, there's no...

06:54.829 --> 06:57.149
We haven't finalized
our collaboration direction.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.550
She was here to liaise first,

06:59.550 --> 07:01.469
and we have some specific issues

07:01.469 --> 07:02.430
to go over in person.

07:03.190 --> 07:04.149
Alright, please.

07:04.310 --> 07:04.968
Please.

07:25.096 --> 07:27.400
(When are you free?
Recipient: Silly Goose)

07:30.664 --> 07:32.968
(When are you free?
Recipient: Silly Goose)

07:41.510 --> 07:42.149
Hello?

07:42.149 --> 07:43.070
Hello, Mengmeng.

07:43.630 --> 07:44.709
Why are you avoiding me?

07:46.709 --> 07:49.430
My car broke down that day,
and I just asked you for a ride.

07:49.430 --> 07:50.950
But you had to let others drive me.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.269
Don't just stay silent.

07:54.589 --> 07:55.589
Tell me what you'll do.

07:57.349 --> 07:59.110
Well... I'll listen to you.

08:00.469 --> 08:03.029
Let's have dinner together
after you get off work.

08:04.389 --> 08:04.990
I...

08:05.110 --> 08:06.430
Stop hesitating.

08:06.909 --> 08:08.550
I'll text the info to your phone.

08:09.070 --> 08:09.630
Bye.

08:25.928 --> 08:27.560
(Silly Goose)

08:33.192 --> 08:34.349
(Sorry, Mengmeng.)

08:34.349 --> 08:35.229
(Something came up.)

08:35.390 --> 08:36.310
(I can't make it.)

08:36.670 --> 08:37.390
(Next meal on me.)

08:42.589 --> 08:44.550
Stupid Silly Goose! Stinky Silly Goose!

09:05.430 --> 09:06.190
What have you been

09:06.190 --> 09:07.030
working on all day?

09:07.624 --> 09:08.469
I...

09:08.469 --> 09:09.469
Don't let Mr. Fang see.

09:09.469 --> 09:10.589
He'll dock your pay.

09:10.709 --> 09:11.829
He saw it ages ago.

09:12.509 --> 09:14.349
I'm trying to help Letao
figure something out.

09:16.950 --> 09:18.509
Working so hard for Mr. Gao?

09:19.109 --> 09:20.469
- Not really.
- I get it, girl.

09:21.910 --> 09:23.989
(Xiang Lingling, PR Dept Manager)
For Mr. Gao, it's worth it.

09:26.390 --> 09:26.950
Good job.

09:27.829 --> 09:28.749
Learn from her.

09:29.509 --> 09:30.749
(Dr. Wei Dazhuang?)

09:31.109 --> 09:32.150
(Such a familiar name.)

09:34.150 --> 09:35.469
(I think I've seen it somewhere.)

09:40.520 --> 09:41.832
(Wei Dazhuang, Chuantu Institute:
A Versatile Expert in Polymer Materials R&D)

09:42.024 --> 09:43.190
(Chuantu Institute Researcher,
Wei Dazhuang, Contact)

09:43.190 --> 09:43.829
Got it.

09:44.550 --> 09:45.829
Hey, Ling... Lingling.

09:46.310 --> 09:47.390
I was thinking I should...

09:51.469 --> 09:52.229
Work on it.

09:53.629 --> 09:54.430
Give it to me later.

09:57.869 --> 09:59.310
We'll discuss this matter with them.

10:07.829 --> 10:10.229
Why are you skipping board meetings?

10:13.749 --> 10:14.749
Give me a reason.

10:20.629 --> 10:22.430
Setting up the production line
is imperative.

10:23.030 --> 10:24.190
The board won't approve it.

10:24.190 --> 10:25.030
So what's the point?

10:25.550 --> 10:28.190
Setting up the production line
is imperative?

10:28.310 --> 10:29.709
How exactly imperative?

10:30.030 --> 10:31.310
Without the board's approval,

10:31.310 --> 10:32.390
where will you

10:32.390 --> 10:34.550
get the funding
to realize your ideas and dreams?

10:34.910 --> 10:36.869
You have to attend board meetings.

10:37.229 --> 10:38.629
Do you think this is child's play?

10:40.109 --> 10:40.989
Are there risks?

10:40.989 --> 10:42.109
Have you assessed them?

10:42.469 --> 10:43.229
Gao.

10:43.790 --> 10:45.950
Why are you two
at each other's throats again?

10:46.509 --> 10:47.509
Sit, sit down.

10:47.829 --> 10:48.390
Sit down.

10:49.109 --> 10:51.150
The board
hasn't made a final decision yet.

10:51.150 --> 10:52.109
What's the rush?

10:56.989 --> 10:57.629
You know,

10:58.989 --> 11:02.030
I've communicated
with all the board members.

11:03.270 --> 11:05.829
They believe
developing new products could be

11:06.790 --> 11:09.469
a viable way for the company
to boost competitiveness.

11:10.430 --> 11:11.950
Li, what are you talking about?

11:12.430 --> 11:14.709
Why are you
siding with his nonsense now?

11:14.709 --> 11:16.550
Gao, I haven't finished.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.430
Always so impatient.

11:19.829 --> 11:20.910
The directors think

11:21.829 --> 11:23.349
that new products are acceptable,

11:24.109 --> 11:26.229
but Haiming,

11:26.749 --> 11:28.030
there needs to be a deadline.

11:29.550 --> 11:30.509
By the end

11:30.829 --> 11:32.950
of this month, can you present
something to the board?

11:34.670 --> 11:36.109
It will only succeed.

11:37.790 --> 11:38.629
Problem solved.

11:39.670 --> 11:41.749
It will only succeed.

11:42.229 --> 11:43.030
I sincerely hope

11:43.030 --> 11:44.749
that you're not just
making empty promises.

11:45.430 --> 11:46.030
Fine.

11:47.349 --> 11:49.109
I'll expect good news by month's end.

11:57.310 --> 11:57.910
Gao.

11:58.430 --> 11:59.550
There's something else.

12:07.709 --> 12:08.229
Hello?

12:08.709 --> 12:09.270
Gao Haiming.

12:09.829 --> 12:11.589
I've found a solution to your problem.

12:15.270 --> 12:16.229
Wei Dazhuang.

12:17.030 --> 12:17.790
Dr. Wei.

12:17.950 --> 12:19.709
When he was at Chuantu Institute,

12:19.709 --> 12:21.629
he was juggling
several projects at once.

12:21.950 --> 12:23.910
Now he's suddenly taking leave
and transferring.

12:23.910 --> 12:25.829
He must be facing some issue.

12:30.270 --> 12:31.430
SAP.

12:32.749 --> 12:34.310
Super Absorbent Polymer.

12:34.509 --> 12:35.349
Actually, for this,

12:35.349 --> 12:36.509
we have a better candidate.

12:36.869 --> 12:38.430
No. It has to be him.

12:39.390 --> 12:40.150
Listen.

12:40.150 --> 12:41.989
He's not well-known yet,

12:41.989 --> 12:42.910
but like you,

12:42.910 --> 12:44.310
he has a visionary mind.

12:44.829 --> 12:46.629
Others might not see it,

12:46.629 --> 12:47.430
but I know it.

12:47.430 --> 12:48.430
You have to trust me.

12:52.989 --> 12:53.829
Dr. Wei.

12:53.829 --> 12:56.109
If he's transferring now,

12:56.469 --> 12:58.030
that's our perfect opportunity.

12:58.030 --> 12:59.629
This can be our breakthrough.

12:59.629 --> 13:01.030
- First thing.
- Let Luo check...

13:01.670 --> 13:03.150
Navigate well.

13:06.190 --> 13:06.989
And then?

13:08.190 --> 13:10.229
Then, be quiet for a while.

13:10.469 --> 13:11.910
Enjoy the view outside.

13:15.869 --> 13:16.790
I just thought,

13:16.790 --> 13:18.430
since I recommended him,

13:19.550 --> 13:20.829
I should do my homework.

13:20.829 --> 13:21.989
You've already done plenty.

13:23.109 --> 13:24.229
Alright. I'll shut up.

13:38.109 --> 13:39.070
Back there,

13:39.070 --> 13:40.229
we should have turned left.

13:43.869 --> 13:44.829
I'll make a U-turn.

14:17.950 --> 14:18.910
WE STRONG.

14:19.910 --> 14:21.190
Wei Strong?

14:22.349 --> 14:23.109
This is it.

14:24.749 --> 14:25.950
The view here is amazing.

14:26.390 --> 14:27.430
If I were him,

14:27.430 --> 14:29.430
I'd take a year off
to vacation here first.

14:29.430 --> 14:30.229
Everything can wait.

14:30.829 --> 14:31.509
It's a blessing

14:31.509 --> 14:32.430
that I'm not your boss.

14:32.749 --> 14:33.589
You will be.

14:36.150 --> 14:37.509
(WE STRONG B&B)
Why? I'm giving you a chance

14:37.509 --> 14:38.950
(WE STRONG B&B)
to be my boss.

14:55.589 --> 14:57.430
Hello. We'd like to see Dr. Wei.

14:57.829 --> 14:59.670
What Dr. Wei? Don't know him.

15:00.109 --> 15:02.469
What? He's Wei Dazhuang.

15:02.790 --> 15:04.749
We've come all the way from Bozhou.

15:04.749 --> 15:05.670
It's about business.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.629
We need to see Dr. Wei.

15:06.629 --> 15:07.190
Is he here?

15:10.430 --> 15:11.589
The one you're after is back.

15:33.550 --> 15:35.349
Hello. Are you Dr. Wei?

15:37.509 --> 15:38.190
Who are you?

15:40.229 --> 15:41.288
(Gao Haiming)
Gao Haiming from Letao.

15:41.790 --> 15:42.950
Regarding polymer materials,

15:43.070 --> 15:43.829
I have some ideas.

15:43.829 --> 15:44.829
I hope to work with you.

15:45.229 --> 15:45.790
No, thanks.

15:46.030 --> 15:46.709
Dr. Wei.

15:47.310 --> 15:49.390
Dazhuang, the engine sound isn't right.

15:49.550 --> 15:50.950
Take a look. It sounds off.

15:51.790 --> 15:52.469
Hop on it.

15:54.709 --> 15:55.310
Excuse me.

15:55.550 --> 15:56.790
Can you give us a chance

15:56.790 --> 15:58.070
to sit down and talk properly?

16:25.270 --> 16:26.150
Are you okay?

16:28.749 --> 16:29.709
Yeah, we're fine.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.589
Sorry about that.

16:33.589 --> 16:34.390
We didn't mean to.

16:34.790 --> 16:35.950
Can we have five minutes?

16:36.190 --> 16:36.950
Just five minutes.

16:37.790 --> 16:38.869
How about I talk with you?

16:40.430 --> 16:41.224
Okay.

16:42.728 --> 16:44.616
(Gao Haiming)

16:45.550 --> 16:46.550
Your previous work

16:46.550 --> 16:47.950
was in polymer materials research,

16:47.950 --> 16:48.589
right?

16:49.670 --> 16:51.030
I visited Chuantu Institute.

16:51.430 --> 16:53.310
But I heard
you might be transferring out.

16:54.749 --> 16:56.030
You've done your homework.

16:57.190 --> 16:58.070
Is there a problem?

16:59.749 --> 17:01.270
Then I'll get straight to the point.

17:02.109 --> 17:04.110
I'd like to invite you to join Letao

17:04.680 --> 17:05.749
and work on materials R&D

17:05.749 --> 17:07.190
for feminine and infant products.

17:07.870 --> 17:09.269
But his research is mostly

17:09.269 --> 17:10.549
industrial and agricultural.

17:11.150 --> 17:13.110
That's completely unrelated, isn't it?

17:13.870 --> 17:14.390
Well,

17:14.630 --> 17:16.309
the SAP Dr. Wei studies

17:16.469 --> 17:17.989
can be used in sanitary pad cores.

17:18.509 --> 17:19.390
Although currently,

17:19.390 --> 17:21.069
it's mainly agricultural and industrial,

17:21.430 --> 17:22.350
I believe

17:22.350 --> 17:23.069
SAP's usage

17:23.069 --> 17:24.749
in the medical and health sector

17:24.749 --> 17:25.509
is mainstream.

17:27.910 --> 17:29.749
My work is research beneficial

17:30.430 --> 17:32.590
for societal agricultural development.

17:34.549 --> 17:35.269
In short,

17:36.150 --> 17:37.910
even if I leave Chuantu,

17:38.509 --> 17:39.830
I won't get involved

17:40.072 --> 17:40.830
with sanitary...

17:40.830 --> 17:41.590
Sanitary pads.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.016
Yes.

17:44.670 --> 17:46.430
Hold on. You're a grown man.

17:46.430 --> 17:47.469
How can you bring up

17:47.469 --> 17:48.549
such things so casually?

17:48.709 --> 17:50.910
This is a perfectly
normal thing, isn't it?

17:51.069 --> 17:51.989
No need to censor it.

17:52.630 --> 17:53.150
Yes.

17:53.269 --> 17:54.190
But we don't need

17:54.190 --> 17:56.190
to discuss it in daily life, right?

17:56.190 --> 17:57.950
Especially between two grown men.

17:58.350 --> 18:00.670
Plus, there are two ladies present.

18:04.110 --> 18:04.670
Forget it.

18:04.789 --> 18:06.190
There's no point arguing with you.

18:06.430 --> 18:07.509
Please reconsider.

18:07.670 --> 18:08.709
Nothing to reconsider.

18:09.469 --> 18:10.350
Let's call it a day.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.309
Excuse me.

18:11.469 --> 18:12.150
Dr. Wei.

18:13.469 --> 18:14.309
Grab the toolkit.

18:14.309 --> 18:15.549
We need to reinforce a spot.

18:16.029 --> 18:17.069
Please think it over.

18:33.150 --> 18:33.830
It's alright.

18:34.630 --> 18:35.870
I think we still have

18:35.870 --> 18:36.830
a pretty good chance.

18:38.430 --> 18:40.110
It's just that they're still

18:40.110 --> 18:42.029
a bit uncomfortable
discussing women's topics.

18:43.190 --> 18:44.789
It's normal. People of this era

18:44.789 --> 18:46.350
think it's kind of a taboo

18:46.350 --> 18:47.830
to talk about such things in public.

18:48.029 --> 18:49.029
This era?

18:51.309 --> 18:52.549
Except for weirdos like you.

18:55.390 --> 18:56.229
Anyway,

18:56.950 --> 18:58.029
we found the person.

18:58.110 --> 18:59.029
We have a chance.

19:00.670 --> 19:01.830
We need to find a way in.

19:07.989 --> 19:09.430
They're not leaving, are they?

19:13.549 --> 19:15.190
Your cruiser is really nice.

19:16.789 --> 19:17.749
You know motorcycles?

19:18.549 --> 19:19.350
Go on.

19:21.630 --> 19:22.789
Long wheelbase.

19:23.269 --> 19:25.950
A 16-liter fuel tank
paired with a V-twin engine.

19:26.269 --> 19:27.229
Smooth power delivery.

19:27.430 --> 19:28.229
Stable ride.

19:29.309 --> 19:30.309
But...

19:30.950 --> 19:31.590
Yes,

19:32.309 --> 19:33.630
it falls short on safety

19:33.709 --> 19:35.190
on unpaved roads and curves.

19:35.430 --> 19:37.670
So the seat and armrests
need adjustments,

19:38.229 --> 19:40.430
including widening these footpegs.

19:41.950 --> 19:43.430
Are you riding the 318 route?

19:45.549 --> 19:46.190
I see.

19:47.190 --> 19:49.190
Given your current state of mind
and situation,

19:49.830 --> 19:50.989
the 318 route seems fitting

19:50.989 --> 19:52.269
to look for a future direction.

19:57.870 --> 19:59.350
I don't follow.

20:00.870 --> 20:02.509
But once you set out,

20:03.509 --> 20:04.350
you'll face

20:04.350 --> 20:06.110
a series of diverse problems.

20:07.069 --> 20:07.989
When confronting them,

20:07.989 --> 20:09.309
if you haven't figured it out,

20:09.309 --> 20:12.110
or if you choose to escape,

20:12.469 --> 20:14.110
there's no way
you'll make it to the end.

20:21.190 --> 20:22.430
We're the riders.

20:23.309 --> 20:24.670
We're the ones experiencing it.

20:25.630 --> 20:26.910
We can choose to start,

20:27.630 --> 20:28.789
or we can choose to give up.

20:29.509 --> 20:30.309
However,

20:30.670 --> 20:32.430
this doesn't seem to concern you at all.

20:34.590 --> 20:35.509
A top school grad

20:35.989 --> 20:37.630
with exceptional professional skills

20:37.989 --> 20:38.989
and unique insights

20:38.989 --> 20:40.509
in the field of materials science.

20:41.590 --> 20:43.350
I don't think you'd give up easily.

20:47.229 --> 20:48.709
There's more than one mountain.

20:49.870 --> 20:51.630
Setting out after figuring things out

20:52.269 --> 20:53.029
isn't too late.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.029
If you want to persuade my brother,

21:00.430 --> 21:01.709
I don't think it's necessary.

21:02.150 --> 21:03.190
Don't overthink it.

21:03.229 --> 21:04.110
I was just

21:04.110 --> 21:04.910
sharing thoughts.

21:07.069 --> 21:08.830
I actually quite envy you guys.

21:12.190 --> 21:12.870
Here.

21:12.870 --> 21:13.590
- Thanks...
- Here.

21:15.870 --> 21:17.630
Your oil and filter
need changing, right?

21:17.630 --> 21:18.709
How many kilometers now?

21:18.830 --> 21:19.709
Over five thousand.

21:20.110 --> 21:20.870
Then it's time.

21:20.870 --> 21:21.630
Got new ones?

21:21.630 --> 21:22.789
Yes, right here.

21:23.390 --> 21:24.229
I can do it for you.

21:24.549 --> 21:26.309
If you're helping, I'm thrilled.

21:26.309 --> 21:27.590
It takes a lot of time.

21:28.309 --> 21:29.910
I haven't touched a motorcycle in ages.

21:29.910 --> 21:30.830
My hands are itching.

21:31.110 --> 21:32.190
Put gloves on, then.

21:32.190 --> 21:32.789
Sure.

22:01.608 --> 22:02.888
(Fortune)

22:06.989 --> 22:08.229
You know your stuff, girl!

22:08.229 --> 22:09.830
I'll come to you for my next service.

22:10.269 --> 22:11.789
Your motorcycle is definitely fine,

22:12.390 --> 22:14.150
but the gear you've prepared,

22:14.549 --> 22:15.190
not so much.

22:15.950 --> 22:16.630
No?

22:18.269 --> 22:19.029
To be honest,

22:19.029 --> 22:21.549
it's a bit amateurish.

22:21.549 --> 22:22.749
Amateurish?

22:23.830 --> 22:24.789
I see you've got

22:24.789 --> 22:26.509
stuff like sun protection

22:26.509 --> 22:27.749
and hiking emergency supplies.

22:27.749 --> 22:29.150
Do you usually prefer

22:29.150 --> 22:30.749
tropical motorcycle trips?

22:31.989 --> 22:33.029
Yeah, that's right.

22:33.430 --> 22:34.069
See?

22:34.350 --> 22:35.069
Each route

22:35.069 --> 22:37.029
has its own gear requirements.

22:37.190 --> 22:38.549
Someone with experience like me

22:38.549 --> 22:39.910
can tell at a glance

22:39.910 --> 22:41.229
that your gear

22:41.390 --> 22:42.590
isn't really suitable

22:42.590 --> 22:43.989
for a high-altitude area like 318.

22:44.269 --> 22:45.430
So what gear should we bring?

22:45.910 --> 22:46.549
Well...

22:49.069 --> 22:50.630
Oh, look, it's getting dark.

22:51.110 --> 22:52.469
We might stay for the night.

22:52.870 --> 22:54.789
Hey, just give us a few pointers.

22:55.029 --> 22:57.029
It's okay.
We can discuss it slowly tomorrow.

22:57.029 --> 22:58.150
Any rooms available?

22:58.269 --> 23:00.029
It's almost the weekend. Let me check.

23:01.229 --> 23:02.469
We only have one room left.

23:02.469 --> 23:03.590
It might be expensive.

23:03.590 --> 23:04.190
Will you...

23:04.190 --> 23:04.709
Guo,

23:05.150 --> 23:06.350
just let them stay.

23:06.350 --> 23:07.150
It's on the house.

23:07.549 --> 23:08.229
Mr. Wei,

23:08.549 --> 23:09.509
let's keep things apart.

23:09.509 --> 23:10.709
We have to pay.

23:10.749 --> 23:11.789
But I think

23:12.150 --> 23:13.749
we are friends now, right?

23:13.950 --> 23:14.630
Sure.

23:14.630 --> 23:15.469
Don't forget

23:15.469 --> 23:16.830
to tell me what to bring tomorrow.

23:17.309 --> 23:17.910
No problem.

23:18.029 --> 23:18.950
Please register here.

23:24.749 --> 23:26.150
Um, maybe I...

23:26.749 --> 23:27.430
Maybe what?

23:28.392 --> 23:29.229
Come here.

23:29.229 --> 23:29.749
What?

23:30.989 --> 23:31.590
What's wrong?

23:31.910 --> 23:32.709
Didn't you hear her?

23:32.709 --> 23:33.670
There's only one room.

23:34.309 --> 23:34.989
I heard that.

23:35.430 --> 23:36.029
- Then...
- What?

23:36.029 --> 23:36.680
Register.

23:37.830 --> 23:38.430
The two of us.

23:39.110 --> 23:39.670
Yes.

23:39.749 --> 23:40.269
No.

23:42.269 --> 23:43.029
What?

23:44.709 --> 23:45.590
No, we...

23:46.390 --> 23:47.709
You... I...

23:47.789 --> 23:49.709
I'm not going to eat you.

23:50.309 --> 23:51.749
Come on, sign it properly!

23:52.309 --> 23:52.989
Wait.

23:53.160 --> 23:53.749
Then...

23:53.749 --> 23:54.309
Room number?

23:54.309 --> 23:54.910
319.

23:54.910 --> 23:55.430
Thanks.

23:58.269 --> 23:59.549
Hurry up.

23:59.870 --> 24:01.110
Who are we here for?

24:07.430 --> 24:08.069
Here's your key.

24:08.509 --> 24:09.390
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

24:10.789 --> 24:11.560
I...

24:12.350 --> 24:12.989
Um...

24:16.390 --> 24:17.830
We managed to keep them here.

24:18.309 --> 24:19.630
The rest is up to you.

24:22.549 --> 24:23.709
I can't believe a CEO

24:23.709 --> 24:25.469
got splashed with mud.

24:27.509 --> 24:29.309
319.

24:29.950 --> 24:31.509
319, 319.

24:32.269 --> 24:32.989
This is it, right?

24:34.430 --> 24:35.390
Why isn't it locked?

24:38.749 --> 24:39.749
This room is strange.

24:39.749 --> 24:41.029
It's set up like a warehouse.

24:41.390 --> 24:42.509
How can anyone stay here?

24:44.870 --> 24:46.430
We must have the wrong room.

24:51.749 --> 24:52.630
Turn the light on.

24:54.910 --> 24:55.549
No power.

24:55.549 --> 24:56.910
Then open the door!

25:01.469 --> 25:02.269
It's locked.

25:02.709 --> 25:03.749
No way.

25:03.870 --> 25:04.469
Really.

25:06.110 --> 25:06.910
I didn't touch it.

25:07.709 --> 25:08.709
Let me see, let me see.

25:09.789 --> 25:10.469
Anyone there?

25:10.989 --> 25:12.350
It's rusted shut.

25:12.350 --> 25:13.350
Come on, let me try.

25:13.350 --> 25:15.069
I'll find some tools

25:15.069 --> 25:16.910
and see if I can pry it open.

25:23.910 --> 25:24.870
Dear me! Dear me!

25:24.870 --> 25:25.448
No! No!

25:25.448 --> 25:26.150
- A rat!
- What?

25:26.150 --> 25:26.910
There's a rat!

25:26.910 --> 25:27.590
Get it away!

25:27.749 --> 25:28.630
I'm going to die!

25:28.630 --> 25:29.309
Get rid of it!

25:29.309 --> 25:30.309
Don't let it crawl on me!

25:30.309 --> 25:31.309
- Slippers!
- Huh? What?

25:31.309 --> 25:32.269
It's just a slipper.

25:32.269 --> 25:32.950
No way!

25:32.950 --> 25:33.549
What was it?

25:33.549 --> 25:34.630
Slipper! A slipper.

25:35.029 --> 25:35.870
It's okay. A slipper.

25:36.150 --> 25:36.709
Scared?

25:38.590 --> 25:39.229
No.

25:41.430 --> 25:42.350
How could I be?

25:44.709 --> 25:45.509
Let's make a call.

25:52.150 --> 25:52.709
Luo.

25:52.989 --> 25:54.110
We're stuck

25:54.110 --> 25:54.910
at WE STRONG B&B,

25:54.989 --> 25:57.430
Room 319. Contact them.

25:57.430 --> 25:58.950
Get the door open. ASAP.

26:02.989 --> 26:03.709
Let's wait.

26:06.350 --> 26:07.190
Speaking of which,

26:08.029 --> 26:09.110
I've never seen you

26:09.190 --> 26:09.950
like that just now.

26:10.630 --> 26:11.630
What are you up to?

26:11.630 --> 26:12.989
Are you making fun of me?

26:13.150 --> 26:13.789
No.

26:14.309 --> 26:16.509
I meant how you were
like a professional female rider.

26:21.229 --> 26:22.190
Oh, you mean that.

26:25.430 --> 26:26.469
Actually, watching them

26:26.469 --> 26:27.630
fix the motorcycles today,

26:28.350 --> 26:29.430
I was kind of envious.

26:29.830 --> 26:30.910
It's quite a coincidence.

26:31.469 --> 26:32.509
Five years ago,

26:32.509 --> 26:34.229
I had a plan to ride the 318 route.

26:35.110 --> 26:36.670
But because of work,

26:36.670 --> 26:38.029
I never got to go.

26:39.630 --> 26:41.229
I scrolled a lot of short videos.

26:42.709 --> 26:43.509
Short videos?

26:43.950 --> 26:44.590
Yes.

26:45.150 --> 26:46.110
Just scrolling...

26:47.430 --> 26:48.110
There isn't any.

26:48.549 --> 26:51.190
It's a blogger review.

26:53.749 --> 26:54.509
Internet uploader.

26:54.509 --> 26:55.830
- What?
- Forget it, forget it.

26:55.830 --> 26:56.630
They are not around.

26:57.190 --> 26:58.269
How can I explain this?

26:58.269 --> 27:00.749
It's a web browser.

27:01.029 --> 27:03.269
I searched for cycling guides

27:04.989 --> 27:05.830
and read some.

27:06.430 --> 27:07.830
Anyway, in the end,

27:09.069 --> 27:10.430
I never got the chance to go.

27:10.950 --> 27:12.029
Since you like it so much,

27:12.029 --> 27:13.549
why not just go right away?

27:14.229 --> 27:16.029
Work isn't everything in life after all.

27:18.229 --> 27:19.029
Did I just hear that

27:19.029 --> 27:20.269
from a boss?

27:20.670 --> 27:22.350
Are you encouraging me to skip work?

27:25.430 --> 27:26.029
Mr. Gao.

27:27.150 --> 27:28.870
If one day you're free,

27:29.190 --> 27:30.150
what would you do?

27:30.309 --> 27:30.830
Me?

27:35.910 --> 27:36.749
Perhaps I'd like

27:37.749 --> 27:38.910
to go cycling

27:38.910 --> 27:40.110
with someone I love.

28:09.110 --> 28:10.069
Someone you love.

28:13.789 --> 28:14.469
Is anyone there?

28:14.950 --> 28:15.910
- Yes.
- Hello?

28:15.910 --> 28:16.549
In here.

28:18.950 --> 28:19.950
Worst timing ever.

28:23.950 --> 28:24.950
This is Room 319.

28:30.989 --> 28:32.110
This is more like it.

28:33.549 --> 28:34.430
I'm so sorry

28:34.709 --> 28:35.630
about what happened.

28:35.950 --> 28:37.630
That storage room was originally 316.

28:37.910 --> 28:39.830
Probably a loose screw.

28:40.509 --> 28:41.670
I'm so sorry that you were

28:41.789 --> 28:42.709
trapped there.

28:42.709 --> 28:44.789
It's okay.
I wish we could've stayed longer.

28:47.630 --> 28:49.469
No, you came just in time.

28:49.469 --> 28:50.430
Perfect timing.

28:52.110 --> 28:53.709
I noticed you have no luggage.

28:53.830 --> 28:54.950
And your clothes got dirty.

28:55.069 --> 28:57.150
Here are two sets of clothes
from my brother and me.

28:57.150 --> 28:57.870
They're clean.

28:57.989 --> 28:58.549
For you.

28:58.789 --> 29:00.190
- Thank you so much.
- Thanks.

29:00.430 --> 29:01.350
Tonight,

29:01.350 --> 29:02.590
can we talk a bit more

29:02.590 --> 29:03.430
with Dr. Wei?

29:03.950 --> 29:04.830
I'm afraid not.

29:06.670 --> 29:08.029
But we have a bonfire tonight.

29:08.229 --> 29:09.029
You could join us

29:09.350 --> 29:10.190
for a barbecue treat.

29:11.029 --> 29:12.309
That works too.

29:12.789 --> 29:13.989
Okay, thanks.

29:14.190 --> 29:15.789
Rest up first. I'll head out now.

29:15.910 --> 29:17.590
Find me if needed. See you later.

29:17.830 --> 29:18.590
See you tonight.

29:23.950 --> 29:26.029
If Dr. Wei isn't there tonight...

29:26.029 --> 29:26.950
We'll improvise then.

29:31.069 --> 29:31.789
Get settled.

29:31.789 --> 29:33.390
I'll grab something from the car.

29:58.549 --> 29:59.069
Cheers!

29:59.229 --> 29:59.989
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

30:04.870 --> 30:05.709
Eat while it's hot.

30:05.830 --> 30:06.430
Dig in.

30:06.630 --> 30:07.309
- Here.
- Come on.

30:07.309 --> 30:07.989
Give me one.

30:07.989 --> 30:09.269
Come on, bottoms up!

30:12.069 --> 30:12.670
Smells amazing.

30:13.269 --> 30:14.229
Boss eats first.

30:16.709 --> 30:18.190
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

30:19.029 --> 30:19.789
Come on, another.

30:19.789 --> 30:21.229
- Cheers!
- Let's drink.

30:21.390 --> 30:21.989
So happy.

30:21.989 --> 30:22.549
Drink up.

30:22.549 --> 30:23.469
Did you both finish?

30:23.469 --> 30:23.989
Bottoms up.

30:26.150 --> 30:26.950
Let's talk.

30:27.110 --> 30:28.150
What do you want to know?

30:29.749 --> 30:30.670
Actually,

30:30.670 --> 30:31.789
we just want to know

30:31.789 --> 30:33.350
why Dr. Wei transferred departments.

30:34.430 --> 30:35.549
It's what you guessed.

30:36.509 --> 30:37.469
Unfair treatment.

30:37.950 --> 30:39.670
He studied hard for over a decade

30:40.630 --> 30:41.789
to achieve something

30:41.789 --> 30:42.950
In the scientific field.

30:44.950 --> 30:46.350
But before he even started,

30:46.989 --> 30:47.870
it was over.

30:49.110 --> 30:50.150
He's already given up.

30:50.630 --> 30:51.430
I don't think so.

30:52.830 --> 30:53.630
Don't give up.

30:54.590 --> 30:55.870
If he persists to the end,

30:56.590 --> 30:58.110
the name Wei Dazhuang

30:58.110 --> 30:59.469
will be shining brightly

31:00.029 --> 31:02.150
in this field for twenty years.

31:02.229 --> 31:02.870
Yes.

31:03.110 --> 31:04.789
The new functional polymer material

31:04.789 --> 31:05.830
has a promising future

31:05.830 --> 31:08.190
and wide applications
in hygiene products.

31:10.469 --> 31:11.789
I am curious though.

31:11.870 --> 31:12.989
As a man,

31:12.989 --> 31:14.549
why are you making feminine products?

31:14.910 --> 31:16.789
When you're committed,
gender shouldn't matter.

31:17.789 --> 31:19.069
But commercial goals

31:19.069 --> 31:20.430
and personal ideals are different.

31:20.789 --> 31:21.910
What do you mean by that?

31:23.029 --> 31:25.350
Businessmen are profit-driven.

31:25.590 --> 31:26.830
Once costs get too high

31:26.950 --> 31:27.830
and profits vanish,

31:27.910 --> 31:29.190
they cut corners,

31:30.150 --> 31:31.670
with no regard for product quality.

31:32.269 --> 31:34.630
They won't listen to my brother then.

31:38.269 --> 31:39.029
I understand.

31:40.709 --> 31:42.670
But not everyone is like that.

31:49.670 --> 31:50.350
Perhaps.

31:52.069 --> 31:52.870
I've said too much.

31:52.870 --> 31:53.910
No, no, not at all.

31:55.069 --> 31:57.069
Actually, the reason
I came to see Dr. Wei

31:57.390 --> 31:58.069
is because Letao

31:58.069 --> 31:59.190
could really use his help.

32:00.190 --> 32:01.630
Profit is one thing,

32:01.910 --> 32:02.989
but more importantly,

32:03.269 --> 32:04.110
I want to change

32:04.110 --> 32:05.549
public perception and attitudes.

32:05.789 --> 32:07.469
If Letao's feminine product line

32:07.469 --> 32:08.670
can proceed smoothly,

32:09.110 --> 32:09.830
we can work on

32:09.830 --> 32:11.350
more promotion and public education.

32:11.709 --> 32:13.269
People won't need to use

32:13.269 --> 32:14.789
terms like "that time of the month"

32:14.789 --> 32:16.110
or "period" for menstruation.

32:16.709 --> 32:17.549
We can help people

32:17.549 --> 32:18.910
acknowledge and accept it.

32:20.350 --> 32:21.029
Yes.

32:21.870 --> 32:23.269
Menstruation is just

32:23.269 --> 32:24.870
a perfectly normal word.

32:25.229 --> 32:26.509
It simply means that this month,

32:26.509 --> 32:28.269
my body is functioning normally.

32:28.269 --> 32:29.269
It's healthy.

32:30.069 --> 32:32.029
There's no need for euphemisms.

32:32.590 --> 32:33.110
Exactly.

32:33.590 --> 32:34.509
The women around us

32:34.509 --> 32:35.989
deserve better care.

32:35.989 --> 32:36.509
Right?

32:38.549 --> 32:40.229
At first, I thought you were just

32:40.229 --> 32:41.870
using the slogan of caring for women

32:42.029 --> 32:42.950
to grab attention.

32:44.590 --> 32:46.309
But it seems
you have some genuine intent.

32:47.269 --> 32:49.150
We're just looking at this objectively

32:49.150 --> 32:50.150
and rationally.

32:50.749 --> 32:52.670
So, could I trouble you

32:52.670 --> 32:54.069
to talk to Dr. Wei?

32:56.390 --> 32:57.110
But Dr. Wei

32:57.110 --> 32:58.350
wants to contribute to humanity

32:58.350 --> 32:59.630
through agriculture.

33:00.110 --> 33:00.749
I understand.

33:00.989 --> 33:02.229
However, the domestic

33:02.229 --> 33:03.029
SAP materials

33:03.029 --> 33:04.150
largely rely on imports.

33:04.269 --> 33:04.910
Think about it.

33:04.910 --> 33:06.390
If we can develop it independently,

33:06.390 --> 33:07.670
and break foreign tech barriers,

33:07.950 --> 33:09.190
won't that be more meaningful

33:09.390 --> 33:10.830
and challenging?

33:11.350 --> 33:13.029
Besides, we live in such a great era,

33:13.029 --> 33:14.469
where everything is thriving.

33:14.749 --> 33:16.229
Why not go with the flow?

33:16.870 --> 33:17.749
How exactly?

33:19.029 --> 33:20.509
The millennium is approaching.

33:20.789 --> 33:22.150
The future is full of hope.

33:23.150 --> 33:24.029
I have a feeling

33:24.870 --> 33:26.630
that globalization
is an unstoppable trend.

33:27.110 --> 33:28.989
Opportunities and challenges
will come together.

33:29.269 --> 33:30.989
To withstand the impact,

33:30.989 --> 33:32.630
we must establish our own brands

33:32.630 --> 33:34.229
and build a good reputation

33:34.229 --> 33:35.069
for "Made in China".

33:37.309 --> 33:38.430
I want to make Letao

33:39.029 --> 33:40.350
a leading domestic brand,

33:41.029 --> 33:42.590
creating greater social value.

33:43.870 --> 33:44.989
That's why we need talents

33:44.989 --> 33:45.870
like Dr. Wei on board.

33:46.590 --> 33:47.150
Yes.

33:47.670 --> 33:48.910
I did come this time

33:48.910 --> 33:50.190
to recruit your brother.

33:51.110 --> 33:51.950
But I think

33:52.390 --> 33:53.630
Dr. Wei and I

33:53.870 --> 33:54.870
are comrades-in-arms.

33:55.430 --> 33:56.110
I want to witness

33:56.110 --> 33:57.670
the future together with Dr. Wei.

34:02.029 --> 34:03.549
But aren't you being overly confident?

34:03.789 --> 34:05.309
Why are you so sure about his success?

34:07.670 --> 34:09.830
Because I trust her.

34:12.189 --> 34:13.189
She's never wrong.

34:22.112 --> 34:25.095
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:26.304 --> 34:29.075
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:30.976 --> 34:36.889
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

34:38.686 --> 34:41.746
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

34:42.912 --> 34:46.364
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

34:47.360 --> 34:52.886
♪Until the world's end♪

34:55.296 --> 34:59.092
♪If I could♪

34:59.680 --> 35:02.496
♪Keep loving you♪

35:03.520 --> 35:05.920
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:05.920 --> 35:10.836
♪Beating together♪

35:11.808 --> 35:15.672
♪If I could♪

35:15.672 --> 35:18.912
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:19.968 --> 35:27.293
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

35:28.352 --> 35:31.296
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:32.544 --> 35:35.296
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:37.152 --> 35:42.932
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:44.864 --> 35:47.889
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:49.134 --> 35:52.800
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:53.568 --> 35:59.415
♪Until the world's end♪

36:01.408 --> 36:05.312
♪If I could♪

36:05.920 --> 36:08.672
♪Keep loving you♪

36:09.728 --> 36:12.064
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:12.064 --> 36:17.024
♪Beating together♪

